		{
			description: [
				"&eFluid machinery connects a stored supply to the process that consumes it. Pipes link the vessels, pumps drive the flow, and valves open or isolate individual branches.&r"
				""
				"&eIf fluid stops moving, trace the line from source to outlet. Check the supply, pump direction, closed valves, and room in the receiving tank.&r"
