		}
		{
			dependencies: ["497B62C9B689DE39"]
			description: ["&eCopper is readily formed into sheets and tubes, making it useful for tank walls, pipes, and fluid machinery. It also conducts heat well, a useful property around boilers and other equipment that transfers thermal energy.&r"]
